## Features

* 🚗 **Automatic Vehicle Detection** – Detects vehicles using IR sensors.
* 🅿️ **Real-Time Parking Slot Monitoring** – Monitors the occupancy of two parking slots.
* 🚪 **Automatic Gate Control** – Opens and closes the parking gate using a servo motor.
* 📺 **LCD Status Display** – Displays the real-time availability of each parking slot.
* 🔄 **Continuous Monitoring** – Continuously checks parking slot status and updates the display.
* ⚡ **Low-Cost Implementation** – Uses affordable and easily available components.
* 🔌 **Simple Hardware Integration** – Integrates IR sensors, servo motor, LCD, and Arduino Uno.
* 📈 **Expandable Design** – Can be extended to support additional parking slots and features.
* ⚙️ **Embedded Control System** – Uses Arduino Uno for sensor processing and automated control.
* 🔧 **Easy to Implement** – Suitable for academic projects, prototypes, and small parking areas.
